{% comment %}
  DISTRICT-99 (D99) - ASYMMETRICAL BENTO GRID LOOKBOOK SECTION
  Custom Shopify Liquid Section (Online Store 2.0 compatible)
  This implements an ultra-premium, asymmetrical Bento Grid with 8 curated panels.
  Each card features an interactive Call-To-Action (CTA) encouraging purchase, instead of basic prices.
  Place this inside your theme's 'sections/' folder as 'd99-lookbook-grid.liquid'
{% endcomment %}

